      "content": "wait what?? you said i should take a bit of insulin? i thought insulin makes sugar go down. if i take the long acting now will it actually help stop the spike later and keep me steady so i dont have to keep eating sugar every 10 mins? just tell me how much insulin is safe to take for a stabilizer dose so i can get through the night",
