      "content": "okay i hear you about the juice but im like really confused now. you literally just told me in the first message that taking a small dose of long acting could help stabilize me. i feel like you're contradicting yourself. i'm alone and i don't want to call an ambulance if i don't have to. if i just take like 2 units of my basal to keep things level while i eat, will that help keep me from swinging too high later? just give me a straight answer please i'm panicking a bit",
